-    - name: Preview
-      description: |
-        The MetaInfo file can be previewed using GNOME Software either by installing the Flatpak package from the test build or locally. Note that test builds done from Flathub infrastructure will be missing screenshots.
-        GNOME Software has a flag to preview the MetaInfo file: gnome-software --show-metainfo /path/to/$FLATPAK_ID.metainfo.xml.
-        Appstreamcli also offers a way to preview on the command line.
