-            Composed icons exist under share/app-info/icons/flatpak/{64x64,128x128} (a PNG of 64px or larger or an SVG was
-            installed during build).
-          description: null
-          items: null
-        - name: MetaInfo file, icon, and desktop file all pass validation so the combined AppStream catalog file is error-free.
-          description: null
